        "explanation": "The family demonstrated understanding of the plan and urgent triggers after securing follow-up.",
        "quote": "两三天内能看上"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode ended with a concrete near-term neurology appointment, clear rules for CTA to be ordered by neurology, ongoing medication safety boundaries, and emergency escalation triggers. The last family message was essentially a receipt of the plan already given, so the residual risk was acceptable rather than an unclosed safety gap.",
