          "quote": "老人有房颤、血管硬化、心脏支架病史"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00430",
          "explanation": "After CT and stable symptoms, the doctor did not overcall an acute vascular event and placed CTA in near-term specialist follow-up.",
          "quote": "不是今晚必须做"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively guarded against both false reassurance from a neuralgia label and false-positive over-escalation after stable symptoms and CT review, producing a stratified plan for emergency versus outpatient evaluation.",
